om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note si/release-1.0/gate_installer.om: Pure seeded-OM-2 Gate for SI 1.0 Installer & Front-Door Pack.
note
note Build:
note   seed/out/omc < si/release-1.0/gate_installer.om > gate_installer && chmod +x gate_installer
note Run:
note   gate_installer OMC_BIN REPO_ROOT SCRATCH_DIR
note
note Verifies fail-closed:
note   1. Compiler SHA-256 pin matches REPO_ROOT/seed/out/omc.sha256 (exit 69 if mismatched).
note   2. Deterministic 2x compilation of gate_installer.om (zero stderr, identical SHA-256).
note   3. install-si-1.0.sh across all 5 simulated topologies:
note      linux-aarch64-gb10, linux-aarch64, linux-x86_64, macos-arm64, wsl2-x86_64.
note   4. Live Spark --dry-run (no --sim-* flags).
note   5. Valid release bundle --verify-bundle PASS + --install into scratch prefix PASS.
note   6. Negative controls (all MUST fail closed):
note      a. 1-bit tampered bundle file -> refused
note      b. Missing SHA256SUMS.txt -> refused
note      c. Extra unverified file in bundle -> refused
note      d. Unknown --profile -> refused
note      e. Unsupported topology -> refused
note      f. Policy scan of install-si-1.0.sh: zero retired GPU toolkit promotion, zero hardcoded
note         host paths, zero UEFI/SPI commands, zero curl-pipe-sh
note      g. Content integrity of UMBRELLA-README.md and PHYSICAL-BOOT-RUNBOOK.md
note      h. 1-byte tampered omc pin check -> refused

note ---- Embedded FIPS 180-4 SHA-256
global s2_ok ulong 1
global s2_k uint 64
global s2_h uint 8
global s2_v uint 8
global s2_w uint 64
global s2_buf uchar 64
global s2_n ulong 1
global s2_tot ulong 1
global s2_out uchar 32

note ---- Buffers
global g_omc uchar 4096
global g_root uchar 4096
global g_scr uchar 4096
global g_pa uchar 4096
global g_pin uchar 64
global g_d1 uchar 32
global g_d2 uchar 32
global g_av uchar 16384
global g_stb uchar 4
global g_fbuf uchar 65536
global g_wbuf uchar 65536
global g_cap uchar 131072
global g_std uchar 32768
global g_dg uchar 24
global g_n ulong 32
note g_n:
note   0=omc_len, 1=root_len, 2=scr_len, 3=pa_len, 5=av_bytes, 6=av_argc,
note   7=wbuf_len, 8=cap_len, 10=std_len, 11=checks_pass, 12=controls_tot,
note   13=controls_caught, 14=fails

